window.products.push({"id":850035,"name":"Fatima Hamsa Hand Indian Tapestry Throw , Tie Dye Tapestry , Hippie Hippy Wall Hanging, Mandala Tapestry,Indian Throw ,Decorative Cotton Bedspread,Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61srtFhq1YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hamsa is the hand of Prophet Muhammad's daughter Fatima Fatima Hand has been a powerful talisman for good luck and one of the most popular amulets in the world of Islam for protection.......... Indian Wall Hanging Tapestry Throw Ethnic Art Throw Cotton Bed cover Bohemian Bed Decor Bed Spread Ethnic Decorative Art.................. This gorgeous piece of art can be used as Bedspread, Bed Cover, Table Cloth, Curtain and of course as a Tapestry or a Wall Hanging. Add an ethnic feel to your room with this cotton handmade wall hanging. Go for a dramatic makeover of your wall and this tapestry would become a conversational piece of art. A must have in any season for all ethnic savvy ones. This is a rare beauty not to be missed, a genuine collector&aposs item & the result of masterly workmanship. These Tapestries are completely screen printed in traditional Indian method and takes around a week to complete. 100% Cotton - This tapestry are printed, not quilted or woven. They are hippie Indian tapestries. Thin as sheet. Good, tight power loom construction. Hemmed edges. Corners have a small fabric loop attached. Each tapestry has its unique imperfections. In some cases what printers would call registration errors are intentionally included on the screen print to simulate hand woodblock prints","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61srtFhq1YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Traditional India","source_asin":"B00Y8FXQ90","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y8FXQ90","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y8FXQ90","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
