window.products.push({"id":850083,"name":"mDesign Compact Plastic Toilet Bowl Brush and Plunger Combo Set with Holder - Caddy for Bathroom Storage - Sturdy, Heavy Duty, Deep Cleaning - Black/B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c0eomE4pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"2-IN-1 DESIGN: Toilet bowl brush and plunger in one convenient and compact format; Individual holders for each item provide simple and discreet freestanding storage; Keep floors clean and dry; Ideal for small spaces; Use this in main, guest and half bathrooms or powder rooms; Perfect for home, apartment, condos, dorm rooms, RVs, campers and cabins; Tucks neatly beside the toilet DISCREET BOWL BRUSH STORAGE: Sturdy-bristled brush deep cleans hard to reach places for a sparkling bathroom; The brush sits in its own holder when it's not in use for discreet storage; If closet or cabinet space is limited, the holder keeps the brush head out of view; The tapered handle fits nicely in the hand and the round disc shields hands from splashes DURABLE PLUNGER: Rubber plunger head creates a tight seal on toilets, bathtub and shower drains, and kitchen sinks to remove clogs; The plunger flange has a long and narrow profile specially designed to work more efficiently with modern toilets; The plunger features a smooth, ridge-free design for cleanliness; The tray captures any drips to keep floors dry and clean QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of BPA and Chlorine free shatter-resistant plastic; Stainless steel handles with a durable finish; Rubber plunger flange; Easy Care - wipe clean with a damp cloth THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Measures 7.5\" x 6\" x 19\" high","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41c0eomE4pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07K7ZH295","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K7ZH295","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K7ZH295","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
