window.products.push({"id":850099,"name":"Modern Retro Style Soft Padded PU Leather Dining Chairs with Beechwood Legs - 4 Pieces - Living Room Kitchen Guest Room - Home and Office Use (Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ernmRiw9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your leisure time comfortably with beauty! The -style chair is made elegantly and durable, it provides comfort and also brings modern style to your home. Soft padded seat combined with high-quality PU leather makes the chair dazzling and soft to touch. The chair is ergonomically designed to suits well in the human's body curve, to accommodate and place our back correctly allowing it to rest comfortably without strain. The chair is equipped with beechwood legs. Beechwood is known to be tough wood and resistant to abrasion providing you a 100% safety and extended durability, making it a perfect pair with the dazzling soft PU leathered chair. The legs structure follows the scientific principle and is strong enough to let people sit and it can support up to 350lbs of weight. The Chair has a retro and fashionable appearance, with its soft and elegant looking design this chair is ideally perfect in any occasion. The wooden legs are equipped with floor protectors, to prevent scratching or damaging your floors. The style chair can also be used in a dining room, guest room, living room, kitchen room, lounge room or even in the office, providing you comfort and style. Easy to assemble, Hardware and manual are included, with the one-time molded steel stand, assembly requires fewer screws and time. FEATURES: 4 SET OF CHAIRS 4 SET OF CHAIRS PU Leather PU Leather Soft Padded Seat Soft Padded Seat Beechwood Legs Beechwood Legs with Floor protectors with Floor protectors Anti Abrasion Anti Abrasion can support up to 350lbs of weight can support up to 350lbs of weight Perfect for any occasion Perfect for any occasion Home and Office use Home and Office use Easy to assemble Easy to assemble Hardware and manual are included Hardware and manual are included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ernmRiw9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DHTM020","source_asin":"B07RRR53PY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RRR53PY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RRR53PY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
