window.products.push({"id":850129,"name":"HIC Kitchen Roasting Heat Resistant Turkey Baster and Meat Marinade Applicator, 11-Inch, 1.5-Ounce Capacity, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jhiEqKAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIC Roasting’s Turkey Baster is an invaluable addition to cooking utensils and chef tools for cooking and roasting all types of food. From poultry to pork, beef, game, and fish, even vegetables, basting helps foods cook to a golden brown outside and remain moist and juicy inside. It’s the ideal cooking technique for roasting, grilling, rotisserie, and other slow cooking methods where food is exposed to heat for prolonged periods of time. It’s specially designed for comfortable use and easy cleanup. The Baster tube is heat-resistant to 210-degrees Fahrenheit with easy-read increments in ounces and milliliters for precise measuring. The squeeze bulb with safety grip allows for a secure grasp and keeps fingers away from hot contents. Easy to use, simply squeeze the silicone bulb and submerge the tip of the tube into the basting liquid. Slowly release the bulb to draw in liquid. Reposition baster over the food and slowly squeeze the bulb to release the liquid. The tube comfortably holds 1.5-ounces of broth, stock, au jus, marinade, glaze and more. For juicy baked chicken and cooking turkey and other oven roasted poultry, use a mixture of melted butter and wine, or cider. Baste oven roast meat with their own juices or use a meat marinade sauce or BBQ marinade for steaks on the grill for tenderizing meat, keep moisture in and maximize flavor. Baste spiral ham, apples, or baby carrots with a glaze or make honey glazed salmon. It also works nicely for siphoning liquids from sauces for a thicker consistency and fat drippings from roasting pans for low-calorie meals and healthy cooking. Made from heat-resistant plastic with silicone squeeze bulb, HIC Roasting’s Baster disassembles for a thorough cleaning. Top-rack dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Set of 2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jhiEqKAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B08KHD2VS9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KHD2VS9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KHD2VS9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":850130,"name":"Sun Zero Barrow Energy Efficient Rod Pocket Curtain Panel, 54\" x 95\", Lime Green, One Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VKHZWUu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sun Zero Barrow Energy Efficient Rod Pocket Curtains bring style and energy efficiency to any home. The woven solid design with an easy to hang rod pocket offers a classic style that fits in with any room decor while reducing light and noise for better sleep; help keep your home cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter. Room darkening panels are made of materials that reduce light, and considerably darken the room. Some light will show through. These materials do not allow a view through and provide complete privacy. The darker the color the better the light reducing capabilities. Sold individually. Hang on a rod up to 1.5 inch in diameter. Polyester. Washable. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VKHZWUu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sun Zero","source_asin":"B01BVSDHRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BVSDHRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BVSDHRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":850131,"name":"Gaiam Printed Yoga Mat - Earth Meets Sky","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518Io1ipSfL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description A comfortable cushioned mat that provides cushion for bones, joints and pressure points with textured surface for secure footing and hand placement. Also, this mat is made of 100% natural rubber! Amazon.com Sporting Gaiam's nature-inspired Earth Meets Sky design, this yoga mat offers the perfect floor support for serious yoga enthusiasts. The mat is made of 100-percent-natural, latex-free rubber, with an elegant, comfortable surface that provides a gentle cushion for bones, joints, and pressure points. The light-tack, non slip material also keeps your feet and hands secure during tricky exercises, so you can perform downward dog with confidence. And thanks to the dark brown color and fashionable silhouette print, it's easy to identify this mat when mixed with others. The imported mat measures 24 by 68 by 0.12 inches. About Gaiam Gaiam was created as a lifestyle company with the vision that, given a choice, people would choose a lifestyle that is healthy and life enhancing, for themselves, their families and the Earth. The Gaiam lifestyle is a vote for individual health as well as the future sustainability of the Earth’s resources. Gaiam strives to provide customers with alternatives to traditional products by offering natural or healthy versions that compare with the style, quality and price of conventional products. Gaiam’s goal is to become the trusted source and unifying brand for Lifestyle of Health and Sustainability (LOHAS) participants. They understand that the opportunity to affect people’s lives with information and products is both a privilege and a responsibility. Gaiam believes in the concept of Conscious Commerce, the practice of making purchasing decisions based on personal values and beliefs. It takes into consideration all the aspects of our lives and the impact we have upon the planet. Research indicates this concept appeals to approximately 50 million people in the U.S. alone. Gaiam's strategy in delivering the distinctive quality for which they are known is to partner with experts in health/wellness, eco-living and personal development to develop proprietary products that meet our customers’ needs with meaningful solutions. The name GAIAM is a fusion of the words Gaia (the name of Mother Earth from the Minoan civilization in ancient Crete), and I am reminds us that we are all interconnected with the Earth, the air and water, and very much a part of this living system that sustains us all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518Io1ipSfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaiam","source_asin":"B000PH9UPE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000PH9UPE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000PH9UPE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
