window.products.push({"id":850221,"name":"MIULEE Cooling Blanket for Night Sweats (90\"x90\" Queen Size) Ultra-Cool Bed Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Absorbs Body Heat to Keep Adults Cool on Warm Ni","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6rgU9YFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆KEEP COOLING：The cool side is made of the latest technology fabric of Arc-chill Cool from Japan, and the coolness value (Q-max)0.4 (most coolness fabrics are only 0.3-0.4),Absorbs body heat quickly,and when paired with an air conditioner,it will keep your skin feeling cool all night, even on the hottest summer nights. ❆DOUBLE-SIDED:The cool side which can quickly lowering skin temperature by 2 to 5°C,transfer the moisture of the skin to the surface of the fabric and evaporate quickly,making the skin dry and comfortable,cool comforters is very suitable for hot sleepers. The back is made of natural 85% bamboo fiber fabric,soft and sweat-absorbent,which is very suitable use it in spring and autumn or night sweats. ❆GREAT GIFT IDEA：We have king size,queen size,twin size,throw size to choose.Cooling blanket is the best gifts for family, friends, relatives, co-workers or hot sleepers night sweats or anyone you love. Take an MIULEE cooling blanket as a birthday gift, holiday gift, Christmas present, Valentine's Day, Women's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day or gifts for any occasion. ❆CARE INSTRUCTIONS：It should be washed with cold water, it is best to put it in a laundry bag to avoid knotting or hooking，do not twist hard; When drying,it should be dried in the shade,not exposed to the sun,so as to avoid wrinkles. ❆TIPS：Due too the characteristics of the product, the texture may change, and fluff and pills may occur depending on the specifications and washing. Using fabric softener makes it easier for fluff to come out. When washed with water, it may shrink by about 3% to 5%.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a6rgU9YFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIULEE","source_asin":"B0B9CJ32VW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9CJ32VW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9CJ32VW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
