window.products.push({"id":850227,"name":"LIBAITIAN 6-Tier Corner Bookshelf, Vintage Industrial Corner Bookcase and Book Shelves,Book Shelf Corner Shelf Stand with Metal Frame for Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RO4bCoKyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stable Structure & High Quality】- The corner bookshelf adopts thickened iron pipe and E1 grade density board. The side of the corner bookcase adopts an\"-\" shaped structure to prevent items from falling. The metal structure is made of high-hardness steel to avoid the risk of shaking, ensure durability and stability, and allow each shelf to hold up to 75 pounds. 【Storage & Space Saving】- 12 open shelves offer plenty of spaces to meet your display or storage needs while keeping your daily essentials in organize.No need to buy two more traditional separate bookshelves, it can meet all your needs with just only one corner shelf stand.The height of the 6-shelf bookshelf is more comfortable,not too big,not too high. 【Modern Large Book shelf & Industrial Charm】- The modern and simple industrial style presented by the ingenious combination of fashionable matte black metal frame and antique wood can bring embellishment to your home environment. Wherever you place it will create an antique aesthetic and update your room style to a new height. 【Multi-functional Storage Space】- This corner shelf fits great in any corner of the living room, home office, study room, hallway, bathroom, etc., works well as a corner shelf, bookshelf, display shelf, plant stand, flower rack. It will be a great place to show your friends and family about your life, hobbies, or small accomplishments. Product Size:35.4”L x 35.4”W x 59”H. 【Easy Assembly, 100% Serve】- The package contains hardware, tools and detailed instructions. Every parts is labeled number, so you don’t need to worry about assembly issues. If you have any questions, contact us, we will provide you with quality pre-sales and after-sales services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RO4bCoKyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIBAITIAN","source_asin":"B0BR23F4YT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR23F4YT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR23F4YT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
