window.products.push({"id":850308,"name":"HOME-X Red Silicone Spoon Rest & Spoon Holder, Utensil Rest with Drip Pad for Multiple Utensils at Once, BPA-Free, Spoon Holder for Stove Top, Holder ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZK8bDwHnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you’re cooking a meal or setting the table, you’ll need somewhere to place your spoons. If you just set them down on the table or countertop, they’ll just make a mess, dripping their contents everywhere. This is especially true if you’re eating soup or something with sauce. It’s just a recipe for disaster. Don’t fret though. We’ve got you covered with our spoon organizer. This spoon rest holds up to 4 spoons. With its spill guard, it prevents any messes from dripping onto your space. It doesn’t just hold spoons though. It holds other cutlery, too. Use it for forks, knives, ladles, tongs, spatulas, and other utensils. This spoon rest can also act as a drying rack. Once you’re done washing your silverware, lay it flat on this spoon holder. In a few minutes, your utensils will be completely dry. You can also use this spoon holder as a serving tray. If you’re throwing a dinner party, set this spoon rest on the table so your guests can grab their spoons as they please. It’s perfect for soup parties or ice cream socials! This spoon holder comes in a gorgeous bright red color, so you can’t miss it. It makes a lovely gift, especially for housewarming parties. Get it for a dedicated chef, cook, or homemaker. They’ll appreciate your thoughtfulness and kindness in getting them such a fitting gift. Whether you get it for yourself or others, this spoon holder is sure to please. Add it to your kitchen accessories and supplies today. It’s the perfect utensil organization tool out there.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZK8bDwHnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07YG5Z6HF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YG5Z6HF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YG5Z6HF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
