window.products.push({"id":850327,"name":"Aston & Arden Sateen Sheet Set - 100% Cotton 600 Thread Count Luxurious Hotel Silky Sheets, Pristine White with Fine Baratta Embroidered 3-Striped Hem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tyHVUf5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ALLURING ELEGANCE: Tri-tone embroidered Baratta hem creates a striking accent on immaculate white sateen cotton bed sheets. With five elegant color palettes to choose from, you will find the perfect luxury sheet set for your stylish bedroom. This luxury sheet set includes one flat sheet, one fitted sheet, and two pillowcases. SILKY SMOOTH TO THE TOUCH: Aston & Arden Signature 600 Thread Count Sateen Queen Sheet Sets' soft, smooth surface has a smooth hand feel. Sateen cotton sheets are naturally wrinkle-resistant, as the threads are tightly woven, which gives them a more formal look than sheets of lesser quality. Heavier than most cotton sheets, this set is ideal for year-round comfort. SUPERIOR ULTRAFINE COTTON: Each Aston & Arden sateen sheet is woven from a rare, hand-picked, long-staple cotton. Each cotton plant is carefully picked, spun, woven, and finished by master craftsmen backed by a highly reputable mill with over 75 years of experience weaving fine linens. Choose from an elegant line of fine hotel-quality sheets and pillowcases. CRISP WHITE SHEETS WITH FINE DETAILS: This collection features pure white sheets with contrasting embroidered border details – three shades of fine embroidered stripes with establishing colors of Fawn Beige, Onyx Black, Lapis Blue, Stone Grey, Dove White. Make a sophisticated decor statement with distinguished bedding and textiles from this refined sheet set collection from Aston & Arden. ENVIRONMENTALLY & HUMAN FRIENDLY: Our sheets are woven in an Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certified facility to be free from harmful chemicals. Treatment plants reuse nearly 99% of all water, while 70% of all energy is wind-generated. Our mill provides housing, education, and access to healthcare to empower employees. You’ll gain peace of mind and sleep in comfort knowing that you purchased ethically sourced bed linens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tyHVUf5TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0BH77SSBB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH77SSBB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH77SSBB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
