window.products.push({"id":850386,"name":"TITIX 4-Piece Silicone Liner Set Make the Air Frying a Breeze | XL 9.5 Inch | Grey-Brown Color| Reusable | Dishwasher & Microwave Safe | Heat-Resistan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CuzQpif5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Just When You Thought Air Frying Couldn’t Get Better What’s not to love about air fryers? They’re quick, versatile, cut oil intake, and make cooking a whole lot easier. So the question isn’t whether or not to use one, but which one? Meet TITIX silicone air fryer liners, the one set of silicone accessories that can take your air frying experience to the next level! The BPA-free, food-grade silicone bowl has 3D drainages that let air flow to the edges of the grooves. The liner mat's base also adds a little more height so the air can circulate more. This combination and process promotes better airflow to the food, making your meals even more scrumptious. Once the cooking is done, use the included hand clips to safely and efficiently take out the air fryer silicone. Product Specifications: Silicone Bowl Dimensions: 9.5 x 8.5 x 3 Inches Silicone Mat Dimension: 8 Inches Hand Clips Dimensions: 4.3 x 3.3 x 2.7 Inches Materials: Silicone Colors: Grey-Brown Package Inclusions: 1 x Silicone Pot 1 x Silicone Liner 1 x Pair of Silicone Hand Clips 1 x Ziplock Bag Strong Material You’ll Love We design our air fryer liners to be durable and tear-resistant, yet still flexible and soft. The temperature-resilient material can withstand -22F of cold and 446F of heat. This means you can put it in the air fryer, steamer, oven, or microwave with confidence, knowing that no smoke will come out of it. And breathe easy when you store it in the refrigerator, knowing that the cold won’t degrade the material. With a large room suitable for 6.5 QT air fryers and above, you can rely on our air fryer silicone liners to cook or bake all sorts of delicious food. Whether it’s chicken, fries, cakes, or cookies, TITIX's reusable air fryer liner and pot are ready to make your meal even more delicious.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CuzQpif5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TITIX","source_asin":"B0BCRWPYJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCRWPYJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCRWPYJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
