window.products.push({"id":850413,"name":"XUDIR Clip on Strainer for Pots Pan Pasta Strainer, Silicone Food Strainer Hands-Free Pan Strainer, Clip-on Kitchen Food Strainer for Spaghetti, Pasta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616GS+GNSDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Safe and durable material: Our filters and silicone gloves are made of high-quality silicone, durable, corrosion-resistant, high-temperature resistant, and can work up to 230°C (446 degrees Fahrenheit) without melting or damaged. Special design: The specially designed silicone clip on the filter can hold almost all round pots, pans, large bowls and small bowls, even bowls with lip, just simply snap the two clips on the edge of the cookware .And then tilt to drain the water. Moreover, this clip-on filter will keep the food in the pot during the entire filtering process, thereby eliminating the trouble of transferring food between the filter and the pot and saving time. Versatility: This filter can easily filter and pour water and juice in pasta, noodles, ground beef fat, vegetables, fruits, and even heavier foods (such as potatoes, tomatoes, etc.) in daily life. Very practical kitchen tools. Anti-scald gloves: When filtering hot food, our silicone gloves can isolate the high temperature of the pot handle, provide you with a safe and comfortable grip, and protect your hands from being scalded. Easy to clean and save space: This filter only needs to be cleaned with warm water and soapy water after use, which is very simple. And it is small and compact, and its storage capacity is only a quarter of the traditional colander, which is very good when working on limited counter space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616GS+GNSDL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XUDIR","source_asin":"B08VW2SQTR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VW2SQTR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VW2SQTR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":850414,"name":"ShadeMart 16' x 20' Red Sun Shade Sail Rectangle Canopy smTAPR1620 Fabric Cloth Screen, Water Permeable & UV Resistant, Heavy Duty, Carport Patio Outd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aJvv++0wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ShadeMart 16' x 20' Red Sun Shade Sail Rectangle Canopy smTAPR1620 Fabric Cloth Screen, Water Permeable & UV Resistant, Heavy Duty, Carport Patio Outdoor -- (We Customize Size)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1aJvv++0wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShadeMart","source_asin":"B08NN7X9V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NN7X9V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NN7X9V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":850415,"name":"Chroma Type 301 Designed by F.A. Porsche 6 1/4 inch Japanese Veggie Knife, one size, silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":123.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O3Rn-MHrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Product Description 6 1/4 inch Japanese veggie knife designed by F. A. Porsche. Ergonomic handle seamless perfection transition from Blade To handle. Special grinding method knife Stys sharp longer and is easily re-sharpened. Used by many top contenders Bocuse D' Or 2005 and 2007 in L Amazon.com Cutting with a Chroma Type 301 knife is like driving a Porsche, and for good reason. Designed by Ferdinand A. Porsche (the designer of the Porsche 911) with input from renowned Austrian chef Jörg Wörther, Chroma Type 301 cutlery excels in both performance and looks. Sleek and sexy, each knife looks like one seamless piece, but the blade and handle are actually different types of steel. The blade is crafted of superfine Japanese 301 steel and hand-sharpened into an acutely sharp angle for precision cutting. The handle is made of durable 18/10 stainless steel, triangular in profile and flat-topped for leverage, a totally unique and ergonomic design. Announcing the transition spot between handle and blade is a metal \"pearl\" that lets the fingers know their position, in place of a bolster. The comfort and control, not to mention the spectacular visual appeal, of a Chroma Type 301 knife have made ardent converts of many chefs worldwide. You'll find many daily uses for this Chroma 6-1/4-inch Japanese-style vegetable knife, from slicing fruit and carrots to chopping onion and mincing herbs. Like a chef's knife, the wide blade allows you to scoop up your cuttings with ease. The knife feels exceptionally well-balanced and stays comfortable during long bouts of food preparation. After use, Chroma Type 301 knives should be immediately washed and dried by hand and placed in a storage block for safekeeping. To sharpen, use only a Chroma original 301 whetstone, never a sharpening steel which can damage the fine blades. Chroma Type 301 knives make exceptional gifts and are covered by a lifetime warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O3Rn-MHrL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chroma","source_asin":"B0000CNWJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CNWJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CNWJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
