window.products.push({"id":850486,"name":"The Complete Fermentation Kit. WITH 32 oz Mason Jars, Airlock Fermenting Lids, Fermentation Weights, Pump, Recipes & Glass Jar Labels!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cS0qvpNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUCCESSFUL & SAFE FERMENTS EVERY TIME: Our equipment in the fermentation kit means you don't have to worry about getting the ferment right as our kit does all the work. AND you can get started on your fermenting journey pronto with the 2 x 32 oz wide mouth glass mason jars included. Along with the fermentation weights, pump to extract oxygen, recipe book, user guide and ongoing support from us - you'll be loving your successful fermentation creations in next to no time! CREATE PRO-BIOTIC RICH FOODS FUSS FREE: It’s no secret that 80% of your immune system is in your gut! Using this kit means you can be enjoying pro-biotic rich foods that help support a healthy immune system. We give you lots of ways to help boost your gut with our user guide and fermentation recipes book. And no need for separate purchase of mason jars. EASE OF USE FERMENTATION LIDS: NEW ergonomic grip! The BPA free fermenting lids are easy to get on and off the jar. Each lid has easy to use large date tabs to set your ferment with, airlock valve that helps release gas as it builds up during the fermenting process, helping create zero spoiled ferments for you. No dealing with stuck metal lids, manual release (burping), messy water airlocks. Lids are compatible with any wide mouth mason jar. ACCESS TO THE CULTURE HUB CLUB: We want to look after you! Gain access to additional recipes & videos, ask questions, meet your fermentation tribe, and MORE! We’re here to help you on your fermenting journey. ALL YOU NEED TO GET FERMENTING IS IN THIS KIT! Comes complete with 2 fermenting jars, 2 fermenting lids with airlock valve, 2 glass fermentation weights, 1 pump, 12 glass jar labels, & exclusive fermentation recipes booklet all wrapped up in a gift style box. NOW you really CAN create delicious fermented foods & drinks in your kitchen right away!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cS0qvpNrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Culture Hub by The Raw Food Kitchen","source_asin":"B08JTMQ682","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTMQ682","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTMQ682","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
