window.products.push({"id":850609,"name":"Olive Oil Sprayer,Keeptop Oil Mister and Dispenser for Cooking Salad BBQ Kitchen Baking Roasting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bxzLzn5jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keeptop Oil Sprayer For Cooking Why choose us? Our oil sprayer has been tested fortimes and times to ensure it can spray as a mist.Push the button firmly andfastly with your thumb,then you will get a wonderful mist or foggy.It fits forour single hand and only needs a little space to place.It is suitable for most kinds of oils or other ingredients,including sunflower oil, olive oil, vinegar,soy sauce, lemon and lime juice, water, cooking wine. Specifications -Material: 304 stainless Steel -Size: Height 178mm / 6.94inch x Diameter 40mm /1.56 inch -Volume: 130ml -Weight:190g Attention: 1.Oil that is too viscous will not be sprayas a mist or foggy.Please check the viscosity of the oil,such as corn germ oil. 2.As a mist or as a stream,it depends onthe way you press it.so please press it with the right way.If you want it sprayas a mist,just push the button firmly and fastly(better use your thumb);if youwant it spray as a stream,push the button slowly and contstant(better use yourindex finger).And your hand may be a little tired when press too much at a veryshort time.So you’d better have a rest after pressing more than 30 times in aminute. 3.More strengh you press on it,better mistyou will get. 4.It gives out 0.2 ml oil one time.If youneed more oil than that,please attention to buy. 5.In winter, when the temperature is low,the oil can be put in a high temperature place for a few minutes.Then it can bemuch more easily sprayed as a mist. Package Includes: Olive Oil Sprayer x1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bxzLzn5jL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keeptop","source_asin":"B07LDDZG34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LDDZG34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LDDZG34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
