window.products.push({"id":850636,"name":"3 Inch Cool Gel Memory Foam Mattress Topper Full Size for Pressure Relief Extra Firm Mattress Topper for Soft Removable & Washable Cover CertiPUR-US a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IVnWQFlNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why choose us? We are a 20 year old store that specializes in selling mattress toppers. We are dedicated to improving the mattress topper sleeping experience. Our products are constantly updated and iterated, striving for consistent customer satisfaction so you can sleep well. 1. Cooling gel-infused memory foam provides the perfect balance of softness and support. Bamboo fiber cover with breathable function allows your body temperature to be regulated throughout the night. 2. The bottom has anti-slip particles and adjustable elastic straps double fixed design, no longer need to frequently adjust the mattress topper. 3. Removable mattress topper cover has a premium metal zipper that is easy to remove and machine wash for regular cleaning needs. 4. Perfectly fit the body curve, comfortable mattress topper fits the pressure points of the body, effectively relieving body pain. 5. Suitable for student Dorms, guest rooms, bedrooms, tatami mats, RV’ s, camping, and traveling. Easy to carry and organize. Product size reference: 2 Inch Full: 53*74*2\" Queen: 59*79*2\" King: 75*79*2\" 3 Inch Twin: 38*74*3\" Twin XL: 38*79*3 Full: 53*74*3\" Queen: 59*79*3\" King: 75*79*3\" California King: 71*83*3\" 40D high-density memory foam is more supportive and is a good choice for those who like to sleep a little harder. The topper can upgrade your mattress and extend the life of your mattress. It can save you money.Tips: After opening, please let it air out for more than 48 hours in a ventilated place so that it can return to its original shape. It is normal for new foam to have a slight odor and it will dissipate within a few days. Low temperatures may take more time, finding the right temperature (78°F) will shorten the time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IVnWQFlNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09M6V3D4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M6V3D4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M6V3D4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
