window.products.push({"id":850696,"name":"CosyLem Food Storage White Canister with Airtight Wood Lid,1125ML(38FL OZ), Ceramic Cereal Coffee Cookies Tea Flour Sugar Store Jar for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0h3W5WsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description: CosyLem storage container will help you to store the food well,it is a great assistant for your kitchen. Some basic information about our item as follow: Package included:1 x Storage jarDimension(inch):4.72*4.72*6.3 inches.Color&Style: One piece white large storage canister with lemon applique.Using in various places:Our item can use to fill many kinds of materials, such as coffee,beans,cookies,noodles,cereal,tea,snacks,flour,sugar cubes,dog treat,bath salt.Nice gift for friends and family, and good for home,hotel, countertop,work office,farmhouse décor,restaurant or bar. Why choose porcelain instead of the glass or iron? ☼Easy to wash the smudge and keep clean.☼Unlike iron,the porcelain not easy to get rusty or burn-in,can use for a long time.☼Colored drawing can make a beautiful and stylish appearance. Warm Tips: ☼Wash in warm soapy water or use wet-towel to clean,then use the dry-towel to dry.☼Do not use the wire ball to wash,for stubborn stain, you can try the vinegar or lemon juice.☼Do not use any cleaning product to wash the container,also not put it into the water or dishwasher for a long time.☼Please allow ±1cm error due to manual measurement and make sure you do not mind before ordering. CosyLem Brand Story CosyLem brand porcelain,is a series of products which created based on the lemons as main element by the craftsman's outstanding craft.Lemons' taste is sweet and sour,just like people's life,always meet unlucky things,we should learn to change the unhappy to happy.As the saying in America: When life gives you lemons, make lemonade. CosyLem means the warmth lemon,when you meet bad thing,please use CosyLem porcelain,it will give you the warm&happiness feeling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m0h3W5WsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CosyLem","source_asin":"B07SL1XMRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SL1XMRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SL1XMRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
