window.products.push({"id":850859,"name":"VIEWSHINE Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless Dish Soap Pump Dispenser Waterproof Sensor Hand Sanitizer Dispenser for Bathroom Kitchen Sink, 13.5oz., S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C7YcyWPKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[NEW VERSION] DISPENSE SOAP PROPERLY: With built-in infrared motion sensor automatic soap dispenser can dispense soap in just 0.26 s without hand touch. The sensor can detect human hands and other items such as pot and pan. The ideal sensing distance is 2~3\". This modern handsfree dispenser can be used in home, office, hotel, restaurant, hospital and school. It makes your kids more likely to wash their hands and it's a nice gift for housewife. LARGE CAPACITY: The touchless soap dispenser can hold up to 13.5oz (400ml) of different liquid soaps and sanitizers, such as dish soap, hand sanitizer, shampoo, shower gel. Soap tank visible window in the front of dispenser reminds you to refill liquid soap on time. WATERPROOF: The electric soap dispenser has no drip and waterproof design. The material of main body is ABS plus PC. It reaches waterproof level of IPX6 of whole body which allows you to use it in the kitchen and bathroom. This soap dispenser is also equipped with non-slip mat at the bottom, which keeps it away from the water in the countertop and stand more steady. LOW POWER CONSUMPTION & LONG SERVICE TIME: This liquid soap dispenser is powered by 4xAAA alkaline batteries (not included). It can dispense soap at least 8000 times when installed new batteries in it. When battery power is low, the LED light on the top of soap dispenser will flash to remind you replace battery on time. There are sealing ring on the battery slot cover of soap dispenser to prevent battery corrosion caused by water. EASY TO USE: 1. Install 4xAAA batteries correctly (see the picture of battery installation, check + and - symbol) and press power button; 2. Open top cover and fill in liquid soap; 3. Place your hand under sensor for SEVERAL TIMES when first use it in order to make the soap fill the dispenser pipe and comes out. We offer 12 months refund service for quality problem and lifetime professional service, please reach out to us if there is any problem with our automatic soap dispenser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C7YcyWPKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIEWSHINE","source_asin":"B09S33FTLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S33FTLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S33FTLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
