window.products.push({"id":850943,"name":"Glad Mixing Bowls with Pour Spout, Set of 3 | Nesting Design Saves Space | Non-Slip, BPA Free, Dishwasher Safe Plastic | Kitchen Cooking and Baking Su","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CrpL26dwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enhance your cooking and baking experience with this Set of Mixing Bowls from Glad!Ask any professional chef, and they will tell you that one factor to making superb meals is having the right tools. Whether you are a trained chef working in a fast-paced kitchen or cooking at home for the entire household, you need a tough arsenal of kitchen gadgets that stay beautifully for a long period of time. Let Glad Mixing Bowls be your partner in providing a smooth and pleasant kitchen experience for you and your family.This set of mixing bowls from Glad includes 3 individual bowls of varying sizes to suit all your cooking and baking needs. The smallest bowl has a 1.2-quart (1.2L) capacity, the medium bowl has a 1.9-quart (1.8L) capacity, and the largest bowl has a 3.6-quart (2.5L) capacity. Each bowl comes with a pour spout to reduce spillage and a lip for easy handling.Product Details:• Bowls are molded from food-safe, BPA-free, non-toxic plastic material• Lightweight but durable and designed for lasting use• Stackable, nesting design maximizes your storage and is great for kitchens with limited space• Easy to clean, dishwasher safe, and freezer safe• Non-slip bottoms prevent sliding and skidding for stable mixing• Non-stick surface lets food come off with ease• Great for mixing, whisking, stirring, and beating• Color: solid red","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CrpL26dwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glad","source_asin":"B09DDVFYV1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-850943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DDVFYV1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DDVFYV1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
